   - The complete I3 diff additionally changes the prelude through indexed `__all__` and `py/run-session`. [linked_prelude_test.cljc:228](/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/test/yang/python/antlr/linked_prelude_test.cljc:228) documents these separately from the rebase/profile migration. The `pysp` docstring correctly describes propagation through its pinned requirement.
